From aa5e46105caa529f1f3438606b296b14155c408c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 14:18:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Agent: Farmer scan verification, who's-present/call gate, and
 payment context
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New FarmerVerificationPanel shown after scan/select, before milk entry:
  farmer photo/identity, route/MCC/shift, payment summary (current rate,
  pending amount, last payment - all real queries), collection status,
  Who's Present toggle, and Call-to-verify flow for representatives.
- MilkEntryTarget/QueuedCollection extended with verification fields,
  threaded through to the existing record_milk_collection RPC (server
  already enforces the phone-verification rule; see migration below).
- types.ts updated for farmers.photo_url and milk_collections
  verification columns/RPC signature.
- Added supabase/migrations/20260905133152_farmer_verification_payment_details.sql
  to the repo — this was already applied to the live project but was
  missing from version control.

No existing Agent flow, GPS/geofence, offline queue, or duplicate-
collection logic was changed; walk-in (centre) collections are
unaffected since the new fields are optional and default server-side.
